y=-1,$ but the sign of the slopes in the required regions (summarized below) do not correspond to the given slope field.\n\n| $y>-1$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<-1$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |\n\n- Equation II does *not* give the required behavior. The right-hand side of\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=xy-x=x(y-1)\n$$\n\nevaluates to zero at $x=0$ and $y=1.$\n\n- Equation III gives the required behavior. The right-hand side of\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=x{y}^{2}+2xy+x=x(y+1)^{2}\n$$\n\nevaluates to zero at $x=0$ and $y=-1,$ and the sign of the slopes in the required regions (summarized below) correspond to the given slope field.\n\n| $y>-1$ | $-$ | $+$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<-1$ | $-$ | $+$ |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325085 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325086 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325087 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325088 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325089 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1041 "selection" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325087 13194139534987 true] [17592186325084 1110 #uuid "c6ad0701-6d7b-59a9-8e5d-8bc9bc8f7ea2" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325085 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325085 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534987 true] [17592186325085 1111 #uuid "754cd560-c7da-5485-b429-5df20753653b" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325086 1034 "I only" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325086 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534987 true] [17592186325086 1111 #uuid "7e45ae5d-cdce-59f0-93c4-8fca8f540255" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325087 1034 "III only" 13194139534987 true] [17592186325087 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534987 true] [17592186325087 1111 #uuid "84fdf06f-ba87-5be9-9232-68630117c9d7" 13